B.adt=s(["Changed the primary mobile statistic cards on the dashboard, schedule, and work-tracking pages to horizontal layouts with cat artwork on the left and three text rows on the right.","Cards now adapt to each section width while preserving gradients, category colors, and the existing desktop square layout."],t.s)
