B.aeY=s(["Simplified mobile page banners to keep the large cat artwork, moved explanations behind a help button, and removed duplicate monthly badges.","Changed mobile ledger statistic cards to horizontal layouts with cat artwork on the left and text on the right.","Condensed ledger, schedule, and work-log records into two-line summaries that reveal details and edit or delete actions only when expanded.","Removed the persistent mobile ledger scrollbar indicator to give record cards more usable width.","Replaced the ledger type dropdown with mutually exclusive income and expense buttons while preserving automatic advance-expense detection."],t.s)
